#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:50
#: eff9178b851c407bae11cb935c06aff2
msgid "It is highly recommended that use small drone for indoor flight and deploy cage in your test flight environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:54
#: 19461787940f4e7b9b898749e16f6837
msgid "If you are looking for a small drone for indoor flight test, Skyviper V2450 GPS drone or its successor journey GPS drone is a good choice. It is very affordable and running ArduPilot out-of-box. You can easily flash it with custom build ArduPilot. If you prefer custom build small drone, there is a very good discuss `here <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/microarducopter-3-props-omnibus-nano-success/32568?u=chobitsfan>`__. The RTF quadcopter frame used in another example video is available from `sdmodel <https://goods.ruten.com.tw/item/show?21806678027603>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:56
#: 99676369da25413cbf9dd1171f80bf1f
msgid "First, you need to place markers on the drone. It is very important to place markers so that they form a stereoscopic, asymmetrical shape. Please refer to OptiTrack `rigid body marker placement <https://v20.wiki.optitrack.com/index.php?title=Rigid_Body_Tracking#Rigid_Body_Marker_Placement>`__ for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:61
#: da33a770653e4b5fbf619f4f2f72367e
msgid "Place markers on the drone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:63
#: 0e05539dbf8e419c989111a2e76b1623
msgid "Then, put the drone in the ground plane and align it with X axis of motion capture system. The drone should heading to positive X direction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:68
#: 17d2a966b94d48489a8d5b3f63b8fad2
msgid "Align the drone with X axis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:70
#: e05e39ceab4744e8b98e341f04b312b7
msgid "Select all markers in Motive and create a rigid body from them. Please refer to OptiTrack `creating rigid body <https://v20.wiki.optitrack.com/index.php?title=Rigid_Body_Tracking#Creating_Rigid_Body>`__ for details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:73
#: 7760027242fe4c0f8f709a4098940a1d
msgid "Configuration the drone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:75
#: ac3e6c92c643475790cb1d563f61344e
msgid "set :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` to 3 , :ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>` to 1 and :ref:`EK2_ENABLE <EK2_ENABLE>` to 0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:76
#: 4f0110fa591a4532b7eaff3e562ed5e9
msgid "set :ref:`COMPASS_USE <COMPASS_USE>`, :ref:`COMPASS_USE2 <COMPASS_USE2>`, :ref:`COMPASS_USE3 <COMPASS_USE3>` to 0. It prevents ArduPilot from using compass, because there are many sources causing electromagnetic interference in indoor environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:77
#: 99d201365dd847a48f47ba9ee4fdd8eb
msgid "set :ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` to 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:78
#: 19bb94f7937e46368321ed86d125d4b4
msgid "set :ref:`VISO_POS_M_NSE <VISO_POS_M_NSE>` to 0.3 or lower to increase the weighting of position measurements from motion capture system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:79
#: 3036d49c242f4e6e8b7713ee5a1c79ad
msgid "set :ref:`VISO_YAW_M_NSE <VISO_YAW_M_NSE>` to 0.2 or lower"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:80
#: 6241f2372f054325a70772b31b9d4f09
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` to 6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:81
#: af65fa6b86ac4d81806f58db62df5cd3
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` to 6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:82
#: 385dd03c2bd142608547912485a81026
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` to 6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:83
