#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:143
#: 9c6dcea214b54a8498250e9f8ced2850
msgid "In order to take off in Guided, Auto, or RTL modes, a valid GPS global origin must be set using `GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:146
#: 5e624e115f5647ab8a86a2f64c37f705
msgid "The latitude and longitude do not need to be highly accurate, but they must be valid coordinates. It is recommended to use the approximate latitude and longitude of the building or test facility where the motion capture system is installed (for example, obtained from Google Maps). Altitude can be set to zero or an approximate value."
msgstr ""

